[2026-03-16T00:28:49.159Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017gGrizmcDU4DWdSsNT6eXA","type":"tool_result","content":"   475→- **Expected:** A message like \"No amenities listed\" is displayed, or the amenities section is not shown.\n   476→\n   477→### Component: BookingCard\n   478→\n   479→#### Test: Booking card displays price per night\n   480→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with price_per_night $150.\n   481→- **Expected:** The booking card (sticky sidebar on desktop) shows \"$150 / night\" prominently at the top.\n   482→\n   483→#### Test: Booking card displays check-in and check-out date pickers\n   484→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n   485→- **Expected:** The booking card contains a check-in date picker and a check-out date picker. Both are initially empty or show placeholder text.\n   486→\n   487→#### Test: Booking card displays guest count selector\n   488→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with max_guests 6.\n   489→- **Expected:** The booking card contains a guest count selector. The selector enforces a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 6 (the property's max_guests value).\n   490→\n   491→#### Test: Selecting dates and guests shows price breakdown\n   492→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with price_per_night $150 and cleaning_fee $75.\n   493→- **Action:** User selects check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\" (3 nights) and sets guests to 2.\n   494→- **Expected:** The booking card displays a price breakdown: \"$150 x 3 nights = $450\", \"Cleaning fee: $75\", \"Total: $525\". The breakdown appears after both dates are selected.\n   495→\n   496→#### Test: Price breakdown updates when dates change\n   497→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\" selected (3 nights).\n   498→- **Action:** User changes the check-out date to \"2026-05-06\" (5 nights).\n   499→- **Expected:** The price breakdown updates to reflect 5 nights: \"$150 x 5 nights = $750\", \"Cleaning fee: $75\", \"Total: $825\".\n   500→\n   501→#### Test: Reserve button creates a booking when logged in\n   502→- **Initial state:** User is logged in, on a property detail page for another user's property. Check-in \"2026-05-01\", check-out \"2026-05-04\", and 2 guests are selected.\n   503→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Reserve\" button.\n   504→- **Expected:** The app calls `POST /api/bookings` with the property_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, and total_price. A success message is displayed (e.g., \"Booking confirmed!\") and the user is redirected to the My Trips page (`/trips`), or a confirmation is shown on the same page.\n   505→\n   506→#### Test: Reserve button is disabled when dates are not selected\n   507→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on a property detail page. No dates have been selected.\n   508→- **Expected:** The \"Reserve\" button is disabled/grayed out and not clickable. A hint message like \"Select dates to book\" may be displayed.\n   509→\n   510→#### Test: Reserve button prompts login when user is not logged in\n   511→- **Initial state:** User is not logged in and is on a property detail page with valid dates and guests selected.\n   512→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Reserve\" button.\n   513→- **Expected:** The user is redirected to the login page (`/login`). Alternatively, a message like \"Please log in to book\" is displayed.\n   514→\n   515→#### Test: Reserve button is disabled for host's own property\n   516→- **Initial state:** User is logged in as the host of the current property. Dates and guests are selected.\n   517→- **Expected:** The \"Reserve\" button is disabled or hidden. A message like \"You cannot book your own property\" is displayed.\n   518→\n   519→#### Test: Check-in date picker prevents selecting past dates\n   520→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n   521→- **Action:** User opens the check-in date picker.\n   522→- **Expected:** Dates before today are disabled/grayed out and cannot be selected.\n   523→\n   524→#### Test: Check-out date must be after check-in date"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd78e25b-7fce-4bae-a91a-1f392b40d970","uuid":"d6d41921-9566-457e-87c2-9a5a4616f4a7","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md","content":"- **Expected:** A message like \"No amenities listed\" is displayed, or the amenities section is not shown.\n\n### Component: BookingCard\n\n#### Test: Booking card displays price per night\n- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with price_per_night $150.\n- **Expected:** The booking card (sticky sidebar on desktop) shows \"$150 / night\" prominently at the top.\n\n#### Test: Booking card displays check-in and check-out date pickers\n- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n- **Expected:** The booking card contains a check-in date picker and a check-out date picker. Both are initially empty or show placeholder text.\n\n#### Test: Booking card displays guest count selector\n- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with max_guests 6.\n- **Expected:** The booking card contains a guest count selector. The selector enforces a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 6 (the property's max_guests value).\n\n#### Test: Selecting dates and guests shows price breakdown\n- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with price_per_night $150 and cleaning_fee $75.\n- **Action:** User selects check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\" (3 nights) and sets guests to 2.\n- **Expected:** The booking card displays a price breakdown: \"$150 x 3 nights = $450\", \"Cleaning fee: $75\", \"Total: $525\". The breakdown appears after both dates are selected.\n\n#### Test: Price breakdown updates when dates change\n- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\" selected (3 nights).\n- **Action:** User changes the check-out date to \"2026-05-06\" (5 nights).\n- **Expected:** The price breakdown updates to reflect 5 nights: \"$150 x 5 nights = $750\", \"Cleaning fee: $75\", \"Total: $825\".\n\n#### Test: Reserve button creates a booking when logged in\n- **Initial state:** User is logged in, on a property detail page for another user's property. Check-in \"2026-05-01\", check-out \"2026-05-04\", and 2 guests are selected.\n- **Action:** User clicks the \"Reserve\" button.\n- **Expected:** The app calls `POST /api/bookings` with the property_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, and total_price. A success message is displayed (e.g., \"Booking confirmed!\") and the user is redirected to the My Trips page (`/trips`), or a confirmation is shown on the same page.\n\n#### Test: Reserve button is disabled when dates are not selected\n- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on a property detail page. No dates have been selected.\n- **Expected:** The \"Reserve\" button is disabled/grayed out and not clickable. A hint message like \"Select dates to book\" may be displayed.\n\n#### Test: Reserve button prompts login when user is not logged in\n- **Initial state:** User is not logged in and is on a property detail page with valid dates and guests selected.\n- **Action:** User clicks the \"Reserve\" button.\n- **Expected:** The user is redirected to the login page (`/login`). Alternatively, a message like \"Please log in to book\" is displayed.\n\n#### Test: Reserve button is disabled for host's own property\n- **Initial state:** User is logged in as the host of the current property. Dates and guests are selected.\n- **Expected:** The \"Reserve\" button is disabled or hidden. A message like \"You cannot book your own property\" is displayed.\n\n#### Test: Check-in date picker prevents selecting past dates\n- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n- **Action:** User opens the check-in date picker.\n- **Expected:** Dates before today are disabled/grayed out and cannot be selected.\n\n#### Test: Check-out date must be after check-in date","numLines":50,"startLine":475,"totalLines":1381}}}
