[2026-03-16T00:52:18.670Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01WCjfDcCBEZPm2VJQc4Qw1K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK now let me look at the V2 invocation path more carefully. The invokeFunction does:1. `lambdaEventFromWebRequest(request, route)` - converts the web Request to a Lambda event2. For V2, it creates a Worker with the event and runs the function\n\nIn the Worker:\n1. `lambdaFunc = await import(entryFilePath)` - imports the function\n2. `lambdaLocal.execute({ event, lambdaFunc, ... })` - runs the handler\n3. `getStreamPortForStreamingResponse(invocationResult)` - checks if response is streaming4. Sends result back to parent\n\n\nThere's a mismatch here—the V2 handler expects `(request, context)` parameters, but lambda-local is passing `(event, context)` where event is the Lambda event object. The handler tries to do `new URL(request.url)`, but the Lambda event has `rawUrl` instead. Yet the function clearly ran successfully based on the debug logs, so either lambda-local is handling this conversion somehow, or there's additional wrapping happening in the V2 worker that I'm missing. I'm wondering if `lambda-local` handles the function export differently than I expected, or if the error is actually coming from the parent process trying to communicate with the worker rather than from the function execution itself. Let me trace through how the parent invokes the function to see where the actual failure point is. I'm realizing there are two separate runtime systems in play here—the older one bundled with netlify-cli and the newer @netlify/functions-dev package—and I need to figure out which worker.js is actually being invoked in this flow.\n\nLooking at how @netlify/functions-dev's main.js spawns a worker thread, it creates a Worker instance and sets up message handlers to detect when a function wants to stream—if the worker sends back a streamPort, it establishes a TCP connection to that port and passes the socket as the response body.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3451,"cache_read_input_tokens":140671,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3451,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd78e25b-7fce-4bae-a91a-1f392b40d970","uuid":"8a8c83a0-666a-4802-9079-1dc289181a03"}
