[2026-03-16T00:58:33.533Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user assigned two subtasks from a checkDirectives maintenance skill:\n   - **FixViolation**: BookingCard tests assume native date inputs (`fill`, `toHaveAttribute type=date`, `toHaveValue`) but the component uses a custom calendar with `<p>` elements for `booking-checkin` and `booking-checkout`. Tests need to be rewritten to interact with the custom calendar UI.\n   - **RunTests**: Run `tests/booking-card.spec.ts` to verify the fix.\n   \n   The user expects `<DONE>` to be output upon completion of both subtasks.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - AirbnbClone app in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/`\n   - Playwright tests with Replay browser recording\n   - Custom calendar component (not native `<input type=\"date\">`)\n   - Netlify Functions V2 format (export default + Response objects)\n   - Neon serverless PostgreSQL driver (`@neondatabase/serverless` v0.10.4)\n   - ZISI (zip-it-and-ship-it) function bundler with `runtimeAPIVersion: 2`\n   - netlify-cli v24.2.0 with `@netlify/functions-dev` v1.2.0\n   - Test script creates ephemeral Neon branches for test isolation\n   - Netlify dev serves functions via `.netlify/functions-serve/` with bootstrap wrappers\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - **`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingCard.tsx`**\n     - Core component being tested. Uses custom calendar UI, NOT native date inputs.\n     - `booking-checkin` and `booking-checkout` are `<p>` elements (lines 259, 265)\n     - Calendar opens on click, days selected via `data-testid=\"calendar-day-YYYY-MM-DD\"` buttons\n     - **Changes made**: Added `data-testid=\"calendar-prev-month\"` and `data-testid=\"calendar-next-month\"` to navigation buttons (around line 310)\n     ```tsx\n     <button\n       data-testid=\"calendar-prev-month\"\n       onClick={handlePrevMonth}\n       className=\"p-1 rounded-full hover:bg-bg-secondary cursor-pointer\"\n     >\n       <ChevronLeft size={20} />\n     </button>\n     <div />\n     <button\n       data-testid=\"calendar-next-month\"\n       onClick={handleNextMonth}\n       className=\"p-1 rounded-full hover:bg-bg-secondary cursor-pointer\"\n     >\n       <ChevronRight size={20} />\n     </button>\n     ```\n\n   - **`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/booking-card.spec.ts`**\n     - Completely rewritten to interact with custom calendar instead of native date inputs.\n     - Key helper functions added:\n     ```typescript\n     async function openCalendarIfNeeded(page: import('@playwright/test').Page) {\n       const selectDatesHeading = page.getByText('Select dates')\n       if (!(await selectDatesHeading.isVisible().catch(() => false))) {\n         await page.getByTestId('booking-checkin').click()\n         await expect(selectDatesHeading).toBeVisible({ timeout: 5000 })\n       }\n     }\n\n     async function navigateToAndClickDay(page: import('@playwright/test').Page, dateStr: string) {\n       const dayButton = page.getByTestId(`calendar-day-${dateStr}`)\n       for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\n         if (await dayButton.isVisible().catch(() => false)) break\n         await page.getByTestId('calendar-next-month').click()\n       }\n       await dayButton.click()\n     }\n\n     async function selectDatesViaCalendar(\n       page: import('@playwright/test').Page,\n       checkInDate: string,\n       checkOutDate: string\n     ) {\n       await openCalendarIfNeeded(page)\n       await navigateToAndClickDay(page, checkInDate)\n       await navigateToAndClickDay(page, checkOutDate)\n       await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Close' }).click()\n     }\n\n     async function clearCalendarDates(page: import('@playwright/test').Page) {\n       await openCalendarIfNeeded(page)\n       await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Clear dates' }).click()\n     }\n     ```\n     - Key test changes:\n       - \"displays check-in and check-out date pickers\": Changed from `toHaveAttribute('type', 'date')` and `toHaveValue('')` to `toContainText('Add date')` and verifying calendar opens on click\n       - \"Selecting dates\" tests: Changed from `.fill('2026-05-01')` to `selectDatesViaCalendar(page, '2026-05-01', '2026-05-04')`\n       - \"Price breakdown updates\": Uses `clearCalendarDates()` then re-selects dates\n       - \"Reserve button is disabled\": Changed expected text from \"Select dates to book\" to \"Add dates for prices\" (matching actual component text)\n       - \"prevents selecting past dates\": Changed from checking `min` attribute to verifying past date calendar buttons are disabled\n       - \"Check-out date must be after check-in\": Tests calendar behavior of resetting check-in when selecting earlier date\n       - \"repeated use\" test: Changed `toHaveValue()` to `toContainText('Jun 1, 2026')` etc.\n\n   - **`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/db.ts`**\n     - Currently modified with debug code (should be reverted):\n     ```typescript\n     import { neon, neonConfig } from '@neondatabase/serverless'\n     neonConfig.fetchFunction = globalThis.fetch\n     export function getSql() {\n       return neon(process.env.DATABASE_URL!)\n     }\n     ```\n     - Original was simply: `import { neon } from '@neondatabase/serverless'; export function getSql() { return neon(process.env.DATABASE_URL!) }`\n\n   - **`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/properties.ts`**\n     - Currently has debug logging (should be reverted):\n     ```typescript\n     let result\n     try {\n       console.log('[PROPERTIES DEBUG] About to query, propertyId:', propertyId)\n       result = await sql`...`\n       console.log('[PROPERTIES DEBUG] Query result count:', result.length)\n     } catch (e) {\n       console.error('[PROPERTIES DEBUG] Query error:', e)\n       throw e\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - **`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/node_modules/netlify-cli/node_modules/@netlify/functions-dev/dist/worker.js`** and **`main.js`**\n     - Modified with debug logging (in node_modules, will be reverted on npm install)\n   \n   - **`.netlify/functions-serve/properties/___netlify-entry-point.mjs`**\n     - ZISI-built entry point: `import * as bootstrap from './___netlify-bootstrap.mjs'; export const handler = bootstrap.getLambdaHandler('./netlify/functions/properties.mjs')`\n     - The bootstrap.mjs is a large bundled file that wraps V2 functions\n\n   - **`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/.env`** - Contains `NEON_PROJECT_ID=muddy-art-91639904` (DATABASE_URL is set temporarily by test script)\n   \n   - **`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`** - Uses `baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888'`, webServer runs `netlify dev --offline --port 8888`\n\n   - **`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/test.ts`** - Test runner that creates ephemeral Neon branches, seeds DB, runs Playwright\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Test rewrite (Subtask 1 - COMPLETED)**: Successfully rewrote all 16 tests to use custom calendar helpers instead of native date input interactions. `npm run check` passes.\n   - **All tests fail with \"Property not found\" (Subtask 2 - IN PROGRESS)**: \n     - This is a **pre-existing issue** - test-run-81 and test-run-82 (before my changes) also fail with the same error\n     - Root cause investigation revealed ALL API endpoints fail with `connect ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:<random_port>`\n     - The neon SQL query actually succeeds (debug confirmed \"Query result count: 1\")\n     - The error occurs in netlify dev's function response handling, AFTER the function executes\n     - Direct `fetch()` calls work from within functions (httpbin returns 200)\n     - Functions use V2 format detected by ZISI as `runtimeAPIVersion: 2`\n     - The ZISI builder creates bundled output in `.netlify/functions-serve/` with a bootstrap wrapper (`___netlify-bootstrap.mjs`)\n     - Debug logging added to `worker.js` and `main.js` in node_modules does NOT appear, suggesting the execution goes through the ZISI bootstrap, not the raw worker\n     - There's a leftover Neon test branch `br-silent-butterfly-a6vgtjxb` that should be cleaned up\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - **SOLVED**: Rewrote all booking-card tests to use custom calendar UI instead of native date inputs\n   - **ONGOING**: Debugging netlify dev V2 function runtime failure. The ECONNREFUSED error on random localhost ports affects ALL API endpoints. Investigation has narrowed it to the ZISI-built bootstrap layer in `.netlify/functions-serve/`, which wraps V2 functions. The bootstrap code (`___netlify-bootstrap.mjs`) is a 150KB+ bundled file that handles the Request/Response conversion, and is likely where the connection issue originates. The random port suggests either a streaming response proxy mechanism or an internal IPC mechanism within the bootstrap that fails in the `netlify dev --offline` context.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - Initial task assignment message with subtasks: \"FixViolation: BookingCard tests assume native date inputs... Tests need to be rewritten to interact with the custom calendar UI\" and \"RunTests: Run tests/booking-card.spec.ts to verify fix\"\n   - Summary request message (current)\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - **Subtask 1 (FixViolation)**: COMPLETED - Tests rewritten, component updated with test IDs, `npm run check` passes\n   - **Subtask 2 (RunTests)**: IN PROGRESS - Need to get tests passing. Blocked by pre-existing netlify dev V2 function runtime issue affecting ALL API endpoints\n   - Need to revert debug changes to `db.ts` and `properties.ts`\n   - Need to clean up the manually created Neon branch `br-silent-butterfly-a6vgtjxb`\n   - Need to investigate the ZISI bootstrap (`___netlify-bootstrap.mjs`) as the actual source of the ECONNREFUSED error\n\n8. Current Work:\n   I was deep-debugging why ALL Netlify Functions V2 API endpoints fail with `connect 